  "description": "Watch now | Australia, Singapore and Brazil produced the strongest setups I found",
  "body_html": "<p>Usually when someone new comes into the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/260c97cb-837c-440a-af21-80f98903eb29\">Main Chat</a>, and says “Hi”, I like to see if there is anything at the top of their mind. Angelo mentioned ETF’s, and you all already know where I stand with our major American indexes. So I felt like it was a good time to take a look at the foreign ETFs. There has been a lot of interest in investing abroad lately, due to the geopolitical turmoil. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"385\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:385,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:197932,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/206854148?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TmKx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F55c7198c-f2bf-4fc3-88b9-c6eb11c8e7ef_3028x800.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>These were simple price action, chart structure reviews. </p><h4>Long Term Winners, 1 Year+:</h4><ul><li><p>Mexico - <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$EWW&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p>United Arab Emirates - <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$UAE&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span></p></li><li><p>Australia - <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$EWA&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>  </p></li></ul><h4>S<strong>hort Term Winners, 1-3 Months:</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Brazil - <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$EWZ&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p>Singapore - <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$EWS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p>Switzerland - <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$EWL&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li></ul><p>Keeping this short and sweet. Market continues to chop around in the range of death…its pretty boring right now. I do not see anything alarming. I love the lower highs the VIX is putting in right now, so I do think a breakout is coming soon. As always, I will keep you updated. If you have any questions, just swing by the chat. </p><p>Thanks for stopping by! 👍 </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
